      "content": "my 3 year old has been throwing up since this morning and he wont take much water. he seems really tired and his mouth looks kinda dry. im worried he's dehydrated but i dont want to take him to the er if i dont have to. is there anything i can give him at home to get his energy and fluids back up fast? maybe some salt or something?",
