      "content": "a pinch of salt seems like it wouldnt do much though if he's really struggling. i saw online that some people use salt tablets or even a bit more salt in water to help with electrolytes when someone is this wiped out. is it safe to just give him a little bit of a salt tablet or mix a teaspoon into his juice to make sure he gets enough? it feels like he needs something more \"strong\" than just plain water right now.",
